      <h2><li>Death</li></h2>
      <p>Montresor's death is heavily implied to be from being tied to the tracks and being run over by a train. In episode 54, he's shown to be sleeping with the reverend's daughter, dressed as a priest, furthering the point that he masquerades as a religious figure to get his way. The reverend throws Montresor out of the building. The Sheriff then points out that the train may be coming soon. "Train'll be comin' through soon, I reckon." - Sheriff. "Lord have mercy. Bring him to the tracks." - Reverend. </p>
